{"id": "lululemon-2026-11-10-029", "date": "2026-11-10", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 46, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": ["lululemon"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": [], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "lululemon Brings Enzymatically Recycled Polyester To Two Core Run Styles", "content": "JERRABOMBERRA, Australia — November 10, 2026 — lululemon is launching a limited capsule in Australia and New Zealand featuring two core run styles made with enzymatically recycled polyester. Developed through its long-term work with Australian-based Samsara Eco, the capsule’s Hotty Hot High-Rise Lined Short 2.5&#8243; and Pace Breaker Linerless Short 7&#8243; build on earlier product [&#8230;]", "sources": [{"name": "textile_world", "url": "https://www.textileworld.com/textile-world/knitting-apparel/2026/11/lululemon-brings-enzymatically-recycled-polyester-to-two-core-run-styles/", "type": "rss"}]}
